# AgentGuard

This repo uses AgentGuard to risk-gate commands, verify edits, and gate task
completion behind a fresh lease.

When AgentGuard's `nextAgentInstruction` appears in tool output, follow it
exactly. When `agentguard done --json` returns `leaseDecision: "none"`, do not
claim completion — run `agentguard done --finalize --json` first and resolve
any blockers it reports.

Before destructive commands: `agentguard risk --json --command "..."` first.
After edits: `agentguard verify --json`.
After running a configured check: `agentguard verify --record-pass <id>` or
`--record-fail <id> --exit-code <N>`.
